{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-11","name":"off","text":"目の前には異世界の霧子\r\n──どうやらまた迷い込んでしまったらしい","trans":"眼前是异世界的雾子\n──看来我又误闯进来了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-13","name":"off","text":"『当てて……ください……番号……』と\r\n霧子は言った────","trans":"『请……猜中……号码……』\n雾子如此说道────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902200220010","name":"霧子","text":"出られません……\r\n勝たないと……","trans":"出不去……\n不赢的话……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-16","name":"プロデューサー","text":"そうか……\r\nなら仕方ない、勝負しよう","trans":"这样啊……\n那就没办法了，来决胜负吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902200220020","name":"霧子","text":"負けちゃったら……","trans":"要是输了的话……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902200220030","name":"霧子","text":"食べます……\r\nふふ……","trans":"我会吃掉你……\n呵呵……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4902200220040","name":"霧子","text":"始めます……","trans":"要开始了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}